  "title": "Vertiv names Craig Chamberlin as Chief Financial Officer",
  "summary": "Vertiv Holdings Co (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced the appointment of Craig Chamberlin as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, effective November 10, 2025. Mr. Chamberlin succeeds David Fallon, who previously announced his intention to retire from Vertiv and serve as a consultant to the company through December 31, 2026.",
